2269+ 98BE DD 36 08 40      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMBASE), SPRID_PUFF
2270+ 98C2 DD 36 00 40      LD (IX+ENT_SPRITEID), SPRID_PUFF
2271+ 98C6 DD 36 09 03      LD (IX+ENT_ANIMTIMER), ANIM_DELAY_PUFF
