 574+ AD02 6F               LD L, A
 575+ AD03 30 01            JR NC, .noCarryA
 576+ AD05 24               INC H
 577+ AD06              .noCarryA:
 578+ AD06 01 00 58         LD BC, ATTR_BASE
 579+ AD09 09               ADD HL, BC                  ; HL = dir atributo VRAM
 580+ AD0A
