1308+ B012 DD 5E 01         LD E, (IX+1)                ; E = width_bytes
1309+ B015                  ; Calcular cuantos bytes de pixel data saltar: height_px * width_bytes
1310+ B015                  ; Avanzar IX past pixel data
1311+ B015 DD 23            INC IX
1312+ B017 DD 23            INC IX                      ; IX -> pixel data
